# agent.suite — the flows an AI operator can drive, in one VM world.
#
# Run it with `--driver agent`: the lab's operator on node1 performs each flow
# from its prompt.md, and the same oracles that judge the scripted runs judge
# these. The tests continue one another's world, so this is one series
# against one world rather than six separate builds.
#
# smoke is absent on purpose: it is a connectivity probe, not a flow anyone
# would ask an operator to perform, and it ships no prompt.md. The planner
# runs expel-node last on its own: it destroys its world.
bootstrap-user-software-key
adopt-node
object-store
object-store-peer
read-remote-peer
expel-node
